{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50732","headline":"宋城道中逢王直方八韵 · 张祜","name":"宋城道中逢王直方八韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二年离子载，发迹自江南。\n马上行寻度，途中语再三。\n始因穷去魏，河北战方酣。\n後以文投许，淮西难未戡。\n谪官逢李涉，狂客见刘弇。\n失意怜初话，多端耻旧谙。\n茶风无奈笔，酒秃不胜簪。\n几郁胸中恨，聊当遂剧谈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50732.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50732","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}